NAME

ulibGetNodeConfigData - Returns node configuration information


SYNOPSIS

long ulibGetNodeConfigData(struct NodeConfig *NodeConfig, long AccessType)
                                        a0                       d0


DESCRIPTION

This function returns information about a node's configuration, specified by
<NodeConfig>.

The <AccessType> parameter may be any one of the #define'd XGNCD_ codes in
xenolink.h (such as XGNCD_MY_ZONE [the Sysop's default FidoNet zone] for
example).
